Subject: [PATCH 101/110] Fittings and undocking

The fitting window's Fit Ship (shipInv.FitFitting) fits a saved fitting
onto the active ship from the pilot's hangar at the station:
subsystems first, then rigs and modules into their slots, drones into
the drone bay and charges into the cargo hold, through the normal
fitting checks (CPU, powergrid, slots, hardpoints, rig size, bay
space).  Slots already holding the right module are left alone.  What
can't be fitted or loaded is listed in a message.

Fixes rolled in:
- saving a fitting with charges in it no longer fails with
  InvalidFittingDataInvalidFlag (the client puts charges in the cargo
  hold flag)
- undocking applies the hull's bonuses to fitted modules before it
  onlines them, so a stealth bomber's torpedo launchers stay online
- undocking right after a login while docked gives undock
  invulnerability again
